 "note": "Original GetEdge work, generalised from a production interview-shorts project that went through fifteen reviewed rounds. The beat-map engine, the overlay components and the QA gates are a data-driven template; the default engine renders with HyperFrames (Apache-2.0, run through npx, no app install) and an optional Compound template reads the same JSON. A HyperFrames rebuild of a shipped reel was compared frame by frame against the original render (see references/hyperframes.md). Kit components port designs from remocn (MIT) and an in-house card field; ParticleText and TypeRing use three.js (MIT), vendored in template/vendor/ with its licence; Inter (OFL-1.1) ships subset in template/fonts/ with its licence. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. No footage, logos or private data ship in this bundle.",
